# Everything here is either rebuilt inside the image or must never enter it.
#
# The builder stage does `COPY . .`, so without this file a local `.env` — real
# client secret, real session secret — is copied into the build context and
# read by `next build`, which can inline values into the compiled output. The
# runner stage would not carry the file itself, but the values could survive
# inside the bundle. Keep this list ahead of anything you add to the repo root.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
.next
.data
.git
.gitignore
*.log

# Not needed to build or run the server.
tests
README.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
docker-compose.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
